==Description==

The [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_flow.svg|32px]] '''Silk ControlGrid44_flow''' command creates a ControlGrid44_flow from a ControlGrid44.

==Usage==

# Select a [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44.svg|16px]] [[Silk_ControlGrid44|ControlGrid44]]
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_flow.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_flow}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_ControlGrid44_flow.svg|16px]] ControlGrid44_flow}} option from the menu.
# A '''Silk_ControlGrid44_flow''' object, is created.

== Properties ==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

